{"id":76,"date":"2011-10-03T18:37:50","date_gmt":"2011-10-03T23:37:50","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/herbbaldwin.wordpress.com\/?p=76"},"modified":"2011-10-03T18:47:58","modified_gmt":"2011-10-03T23:47:58","slug":"94th-annual-gymanfu-ganu-homer-ohio","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2011\/10\/03\/94th-annual-gymanfu-ganu-homer-ohio\/","title":{"rendered":"94th Annual Gymanfu Ganu @ Homer, Ohio"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Kathy, David, and I had the pleasure of attending the 94th Annual Gymanfu Ganu in Gomer, Ohio on Sunday evening, October 2nd, 2011.  Gomer is a Welsh settlement founded in 1833 by Mr.&#8217;s Watkins, Roberts, and Nicholas.  Click on the arrow in the center of the YouTube video below:<\/p>\n<p>[youtube http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=F_AMm66ZBEk&amp;w=560&amp;h=315]<\/p>\n<p>The Welsh Congregational Church, founded in 1873, in Gomer hosted the songfest and we had an oppotunity to visit the Welsh Heritage Museum across the street from the church.<\/p>\n<p>Here is a slideshow of some of the pix I took before and during the Gymanfu Ganu (songfest).  Just click on the picture and then you&#8217;ll be taken to an online Picasa photo album.  You can then click on individual pictures or on &#8220;slide show&#8221;<\/p>\n<table style=\"width:194px;\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" style=\"height:194px;background:url('\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/s\/c\/transparent_album_background.gif') no-repeat left;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/herbsells\/GymanfuGanu94thAnnual?authuser=0&amp;feat=embedwebsite\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-jmNkc0OhIlM\/TootnW3SJBE\/AAAAAAAACDc\/6Tr4bomRGjU\/s160-c\/GymanfuGanu94thAnnual.jpg\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" style=\"margin:1px 0 0 4px;\"><\/a><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/herbsells\/GymanfuGanu94thAnnual?authuser=0&amp;feat=embedwebsite\" style=\"color:#4D4D4D;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;\">Gymanfu Ganu, 94th Annual<\/a><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Kathy, David, and I had the pleasure of attending the 94th Annual Gymanfu Ganu in Gomer, Ohio on Sunday evening, October 2nd, 2011. Gomer is a Welsh settlement founded in 1833 by Mr.&#8217;s Watkins, Roberts, and Nicholas. Click on the arrow in the center of the YouTube video below: [youtube http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=F_AMm66ZBEk&amp;w=560&amp;h=315] The Welsh Congregational Church, &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2011\/10\/03\/94th-annual-gymanfu-ganu-homer-ohio\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">94th Annual Gymanfu Ganu @ Homer, Ohio<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[91,406],"tags":[24218731,2769649,2312737],"class_list":["post-76","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-blogging","category-family","tag-family-2","tag-gomer","tag-songfest"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/76","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=76"}],"version-history":[{"count":15,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/76\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":91,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/76\/revisions\/91"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=76"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category